LAYOUT SYSTEM GDSII
LAYOUT PRIMARY TOPCELL
LAYOUT PATH "./layout0.gds"
DRC RESULTS DATABASE drc.results


LAYER P1 9991
LAYER MAP 9991 DATATYPE == 0 9991

LAYER P2 9992
LAYER MAP 9992 DATATYPE == 0 9992

CONNECT P1 M1
CONNECT P2 M2

LAYOUT POLYGON 2 0 3.7 0.5 3.8 P1 TOPCELL
LAYOUT POLYGON 2 2.8 0.9 3.3 1.0 P2 TOPCELL


GROUP P_CHECK CHECK?
DRC SELECT CHECK P_CHECK

CHECK_P1 {COPY P1}
CHECK_P2 {COPY P2}
CHECK_CONNECTION {NET AREA RATIO P1 P2 > 0}


INCLUDE ./layer.svrf
